{'symbol': 'AES', 'date': '2022-02-25 17:00:00', 'title': 'AES ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ARLINGTON, VA., FEB. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE AES CORPORATION (NYSE: AES) DECLARED A QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND OF $0.1580 PER SHARE PAYABLE ON MAY 13, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON APRIL 29, 2022.'}